* annex.backend=MD5E
**/.git* annex.largefiles=nothing

# Keep docs readable on GitHub (plain git, not annex pointers).
*.md annex.largefiles=nothing

# Code stays in plain git too, and for a sharper reason than the docs above.
# The test suite exists to be runnable in a fresh clone -- the case where the
# annex content is absent and `bin/verify.cljs` must refuse rather than report
# a pass. An annexed checker is a dangling symlink in exactly that clone, so
# annexing it would disarm it precisely where it matters.
#
# Measured both ways with `datalad save` (the tool this dataset is maintained
# with; a plain `git add` annexes nothing here and so proves nothing): without
# these three lines a test/*.cljs lands as mode 120000, with them as 100644.
src/** annex.largefiles=nothing
test/** annex.largefiles=nothing
bin/** annex.largefiles=nothing
